  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text { Hint : } \\sum_{k=0}^1(-1)^k a_{2 k} \\\\\n& =a_0-a_2+a_4-a_6+a_8 \\ldots . a_{14} \\\\\n& \\left(1+x+x^2+x^3\\right)^5=a_0+a_1 x+\\ldots . .+a_{15} x^{15} \\\\\n& \\text { put } x=i \\\\\n& \\left(1+i+i^2+i^3\\right)^5=a_0+a_1 i+a_2 i^2+\\ldots .+a_{15} i^{15}\n\\end{aligned}$\nequating real part\n$a_0-a_2+a_4-a_6+a_8 \\ldots \\ldots . a_{14}=0$",
